    "details": "<p><strong>Join the group for information:&nbsp;</strong><a href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/DIP6pafp7l58QLNm998u2Z\">https://chat.whatsapp.com/DIP6pafp7l58QLNm998u2Z</a></p>\n<p><strong><br />FutureStack HACKATHON</strong></p>\n<p>FutureStack is a national-level online hackathon where students, developers and designers can transform innovative ideas into functional technology products.</p>\n<p><strong>Hackathon Details</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Hackathon Starts:</strong> 20 October 2026</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong> 48 hours</li>\n<li><strong>Mode:</strong> Completely online</li>\n<li><strong>Team Size:</strong> 1&ndash;4 members</li>\n<li><strong>Registration Fee:</strong> Absolutely FREE</li>\n<li><strong>Verifiable Digital Certificate for all participants</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Top Three Teams Receive</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Incubation Opportunities</li>\n<li>Ppo Opportunities</li>\n<li>N8n Pro Plan</li>\n<li>Winner Certificates and Project Recognition</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Top Ten Teams Receive</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><code dir=\"ltr\">.xyz</code></strong> <strong>Domains</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>$100 in Technology Credits for Every Eligible Participant</p>\n<p>100+ Reward Recipients</p>\n<p>Across the Main Hackathon, Track Awards, Sponsor Challenges, Mini-Challenges and Giveaways.</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Participants May Also Receive:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Mentorship and Technical Resources</li>\n<li>Portfolio-Ready Product-Building Experience</li>\n<li>Project Promotion Through Organizer and Partner Communities</li>\n<li>Additional Sponsor and Mini-Challenge Rewards</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Verifiable Digital Certificates</strong></p>\n<p>Every Eligible Participant Who Completes the Hackathon and Makes a Valid Final Submission Will Receive a Verifiable Digital Participation Certificate. Registration Alone Will Not Qualify a Participant for A Certificate.</p>\n<p>Incubation, Pp Os and Partner Benefits Are Subject to Eligibility Requirements, Availability and The Respective Partner&rsquo;s Selection Process.</p>\n<p><strong>Build something useful. Compete nationally. Take your idea beyond the hackathon.</strong></p>",
